en</persName><birth notBefore="1030-01-01" notAfter="1200-12-31">after 1030 before 1200</birth><death notBefore="1110-01-01" notAfter="1280-12-31">after 1110 before 1280</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4893</idno><idno type="APIS">7418</idno><note type="comment">Son of a siddha named La stod dkar po. Said to have "taken the see" (it is not specified of which institution) after Zhang e pa (ID:6660) ([3HXACZSD]: 214, based on the Red Annals).&#13;
